        { title: 'Paying before the scope is written', text: 'If the model, features and exclusions are unclear, the payment talk is premature.' },
        { title: 'Assuming site prep is included', text: 'Access, grading, gravel, concrete and drainage should be assigned before scheduling.' },
        { title: 'Choosing upgrades before a budget range', text: 'Doors, porches and finishes add up quickly without a comfortable overall range.' },
        { title: 'Treating financing approval as affordability', text: 'Review the monthly cost, term, fees and total obligation.' },
        { title: 'Confusing a shell with a finished room', text: 'Interior finish and comfort systems are separately defined.' },
